;==============================================================================
; JTAG: JTAG SMC: programs the GPU JTAG port to set up the NAND->SDRAM DMA, hooks IPC 0x04 to start it
; reproduces: SMCx
; Tiros' JTAG SMC. A ljmp at 0x1148 (before the CPU leaves reset) runs jtag_main,
; which bit-bangs the GPU JTAG port (jtag_program_port) to set up a NAND->SDRAM DMA.
; IPC 0x04 (kernel RTC read) is hooked to fire the DMA via SFCX once JTAG is ready.
; DBG_LED0-3 are repurposed as GPU_TDI/TMS/TRST/TCLK.
;==============================================================================
